@startuml teacher search question
title Teacher Search Question — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher <<actor>>
boundary "QuestionSearchPage" as UI <<boundary>>
control "QuestionController" as Controller <<control>>
control "QuestionService" as Service <<control>>
control "QuestionRepository" as Repository <<control>>
entity "Question" as Question <<entity>>
database "MySQL" as DB <<entity>>

Teacher -> UI: Enter search query
UI -> Controller: GET /questions?query=...
Controller -> Service: searchQuestions(query, filters)
Service -> Repository: search(query, filters)
Repository -> DB: SELECT ... WHERE MATCH
Question --> Repository: resultSet
Repository --> Service: questions
Service --> Controller: questions
Controller --> UI: render results

@enduml